- Intended target point.
- Projectile initial direction.

Use these visual markers to verify the geometry.

Remove or disable the debug visualization in normal gameplay.

Test aiming at:

- A nearby target.
- A distant target.
- A target to the left.
- A target to the right.
- A target above.
- A target below.
- A target near a wall.

The crossbow must consistently fire toward the intended aiming point, subject to its configured projectile physics.

Do not declare this bug fixed until the actual projectile direction has been tested.

